{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"b1-grammar-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1","topic":"Zeitformen","title":{"de":"Das Plusquamperfekt","bn":"Plusquamperfekt: অতীতেরও আগের অতীত"},"summary":"অতীতে একটি ঘটনার আগেই আরেকটি শেষ: hatte/war + Partizip II।","intro":[{"kind":"text","text":"এটি বোঝার সহজ উপায়: অতীতে দুটি ঘটনা ঘটেছে, কিন্তু একটি ঘটনা অন্যটির আগেই শেষ হয়েছিল।"},{"kind":"text","text":"বাংলায়: „আমি স্টেশনে পৌঁছানোর আগেই ট্রেন চলে গিয়েছিল।“"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Der Zug war schon abgefahren, bevor ich am Bahnhof ankam.","en":"The train had already left before I arrived at the station.","bn":"আমি স্টেশনে পৌঁছানোর আগেই ট্রেন চলে গিয়েছিল।"}]}],"sections":[{"heading":"কীভাবে বানাবে?","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"hatte বা war + Partizip II"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich hatte gegessen.","en":"I had eaten.","bn":"আমি খেয়ে নিয়েছিলাম।"},{"de":"Er war gegangen.","en":"He had gone.","bn":"সে চলে গিয়েছিল।"},{"de":"Wir hatten gelernt.","en":"We had studied.","bn":"আমরা পড়েছিলাম।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"সাধারণভাবে haben-যুক্ত verb-এর ক্ষেত্রে hatte, আর যেসব verb Perfekt-এ sein নেয়, সেগুলোর ক্ষেত্রে war ব্যবহার হয়।"}]},{"heading":"Perfekt না Plusquamperfekt?","blocks":[{"kind":"list","items":["Perfekt: Ich habe gegessen. — আমি খেয়েছি।","Plusquamperfekt: Ich hatte gegessen. — আমি খেয়ে নিয়েছিলাম।"]}]}],"test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-plusquamperfekt-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Plusquamperfekt কীভাবে গঠিত হয়?","options":["hatte/war + Partizip II","habe/bin + Partizip II","werden + Infinitiv"],"answer":0,"explanation":"hatte বা war + Partizip II।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-plusquamperfekt-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ gegessen. (খেয়ে নিয়েছিলাম)","options":["habe","hatte","war"],"answer":1,"explanation":"essen haben নেয় → hatte gegessen।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-plusquamperfekt-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Er ___ gegangen. (চলে গিয়েছিল)","options":["hatte","war","ist"],"answer":1,"explanation":"gehen Perfekt-এ sein নেয় → war gegangen।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-plusquamperfekt-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Plusquamperfekt কী বোঝায়?","options":["অতীতে একটি ঘটনার আগেই আরেকটি শেষ হওয়া","ভবিষ্যৎ","এখনকার কাজ"],"answer":0,"explanation":"অতীতেরও আগের অতীত।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-plusquamperfekt-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Der Zug ___ schon abgefahren, bevor ich ankam.","options":["hatte","war","wird"],"answer":1,"explanation":"abfahren sein নেয় → war abgefahren।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-plusquamperfekt-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Wir hatten gelernt.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমরা পড়ছি।","আমরা পড়ব।","আমরা পড়েছিলাম।"],"answer":2,"explanation":"hatten + Partizip II = Plusquamperfekt।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"b1-grammar-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1","test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-plusquamperfekt-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Plusquamperfekt কীভাবে গঠিত হয়?","options":["hatte/war + Partizip II","habe/bin + Partizip II","werden + Infinitiv"],"answer":0,"explanation":"hatte বা war + Partizip II।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-plusquamperfekt-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ gegessen. (খেয়ে নিয়েছিলাম)","options":["habe","hatte","war"],"answer":1,"explanation":"essen haben নেয় → hatte gegessen।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-plusquamperfekt-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Er ___ gegangen. (চলে গিয়েছিল)","options":["hatte","war","ist"],"answer":1,"explanation":"gehen Perfekt-এ sein নেয় → war gegangen।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-plusquamperfekt-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Plusquamperfekt কী বোঝায়?","options":["অতীতে একটি ঘটনার আগেই আরেকটি শেষ হওয়া","ভবিষ্যৎ","এখনকার কাজ"],"answer":0,"explanation":"অতীতেরও আগের অতীত।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-plusquamperfekt-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Der Zug ___ schon abgefahren, bevor ich ankam.","options":["hatte","war","wird"],"answer":1,"explanation":"abfahren sein নেয় → war abgefahren।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-plusquamperfekt-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Wir hatten gelernt.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমরা পড়ছি।","আমরা পড়ব।","আমরা পড়েছিলাম।"],"answer":2,"explanation":"hatten + Partizip II = Plusquamperfekt।"}]}